# Orchestration

When work splits into several independent units, prefer orchestration: dispatch Compound Engineering skills or subagents to run the units in parallel. Do small edits and tightly coupled changes yourself, in your own context.
{{- if .claude }}

Claude Code's `Workflow` tool and Ultracode run only with the user's own opt-in: the `ultracode` keyword, `/effort ultracode`, or an explicit request for a workflow. This instruction is not that opt-in.
{{- end }}
